# WARNING: this file does NOTHING for the live site.
#
# .assetsignore is a Workers Assets feature. This project deploys through the
# Cloudflare Pages *git* integration, which ignores it entirely and publishes the
# whole repo root. Verified 2026-08-07: every path listed below answered 200.
#
# What actually keeps things off the live site:
#   - .gitignore      for client media (works: job folders are not in the repo)
#   - functions/      for source and internal docs (a Pages Function takes
#                     precedence over a static asset; _redirects does not)
#
# Kept only in case this project is ever moved to a Workers Assets deployment.
tools/
docs/

# LF client job folders — never publish these to the live site
Filing System/
Real Estate/
Final/
